// Gen 4 moves (Diamond/Pearl/Platinum/HeartGold/SoulSilver) added on top of FireRed's data.
// FireRed's move/species JSON (web/assets/data) is extracted ROM data and stays untouched: indexData()
// in data.js merges these into D.moves and into the species' learnsets / TM-HM / tutor lists at load.
//
// GEN4_MOVES (hand-written): how each move works here, mapped onto effects.js keys.
// gen4_data.js (generated by tools/gen4_moves_data.mjs from PokéAPI's CSVs): base stats, physical/special,
// and which Gen 1-3 species learn each move in Gen 4 (level-up at the Gen 4 level, TM/HM, tutor).
// Powers/accuracies are PokéAPI's current values. Physical/special lives in move_categories.js.

